flowchart LR
  subgraph People[People and roles]
    Tenant[Tenant]
    Landlord[Landlord]
    Admin[Admin]
  end

  subgraph Clients[Client applications]
    Web[Rentra Web<br/>React + TypeScript + Vite<br/>React Router, Zustand, React Query]
    Mobile[Rentra Mobile<br/>Expo + React Native<br/>Login/register + role home screens<br/>Current app is a starter shell]
  end

  subgraph Edge[API and security]
    Axios[Web Axios client<br/>API base URL + bearer access token<br/>refresh token handling]
    MobileClient[Mobile Axios client<br/>Secure token storage]
    API[NestJS + Express REST API<br/>Global /api prefix<br/>ValidationPipe + Swagger /api/docs + CORS]
    Guards[JWT authentication<br/>RolesGuard + ADMIN / LANDLORD / TENANT rules<br/>DTO validation]
  end

  Tenant --> Web
  Landlord --> Web
  Admin --> Web
  Tenant --> Mobile
  Landlord --> Mobile
  Admin --> Mobile
  Web --> Axios --> API
  Mobile --> MobileClient --> API
  API --> Guards

  subgraph Backend[Backend feature modules]
    Identity[Identity and trust<br/>auth · users · verification · trust-score]
    Supply[Property supply and discovery<br/>properties · listings · locations · availability<br/>favorites · saved-searches · recommendations]
    Tenancy[Rental lifecycle<br/>rental-requests · bookings · agreements<br/>payments · boost · reviews]
    Safety[Safety and operations<br/>admin · reports · disputes · audit<br/>support tickets · contact]
    Comms[Communication<br/>messages · notifications]
    Shared[Shared infrastructure<br/>PrismaService · config · guards · audit trail]
  end
  Guards --> Identity
  Guards --> Supply
  Guards --> Tenancy
  Guards --> Safety
  Guards --> Comms
  Identity --> Shared
  Supply --> Shared
  Tenancy --> Shared
  Safety --> Shared
  Comms --> Shared

  subgraph Data[Data layer]
    Prisma[Prisma Client<br/>schema + migrations<br/>packages/database/prisma]
    Postgres[(PostgreSQL<br/>users and roles · properties/listings/images<br/>search/favorites · rental requests/bookings<br/>agreements/payments · messages/notifications<br/>verification/reports/disputes/audit/support)]
  end
  Shared --> Prisma --> Postgres

  subgraph External[External providers configured/in use]
    Cloudinary[Cloudinary<br/>property image upload and deletion]
    Gmail[Gmail SMTP<br/>verification and auth email delivery]
    PayAdapters[Payment adapter interface<br/>currently no provider adapters registered<br/>online provider payment unavailable]
  end
  Supply --> Cloudinary
  Identity --> Gmail
  Tenancy -. payment flow awaits adapter .-> PayAdapters

  subgraph AI[AI capability status]
    AIService[Python FastAPI service<br/>packages/ai-service<br/>currently /health only]
    AIUI[Web Fake Detector page<br/>shows reports confirmed by admin<br/>does not run an AI scan]
    Future[Future integration ideas<br/>listing fraud/risk scoring · rent estimation<br/>search recommendations · document triage<br/>human admin review remains in control]
  end
  AIUI --> Safety
  AIService -. future authenticated API integration .-> API
  AIService -. future model/service calls .-> Future

  subgraph MainFlows[Main product flows]
    Signup[Register / login]
    List[Create property → add images → create listing]
    Rent[Browse/search → rental request → booking]
    Contract[Agreement → rent/payment records]
    SupportFlow[User support ticket → admin opens/replies/status update]
    Notice[Admin sends notice → user chat inbox + unread state]
  end
  Signup --> Identity
  List --> Supply
  Rent --> Supply --> Tenancy
  Contract --> Tenancy
  SupportFlow --> Safety
  Notice --> Safety --> Comms
  Comms --> Postgres

